<title>KYRGYZSTAN: Kyrgyz Aug inflation 0.5 pct after July price fall.</title>
<headline>Kyrgyz Aug inflation 0.5 pct after July price fall.</headline>
<dateline>BISHKEK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kyrgyzstan's monthly consumer price inflation was 0.5 percent in August, after a 2.1 percent price fall in July, the National Statistics Committee said on Friday.</p>
<p>    KYRGYZSTAN CONSUMER PRICES  AUG 96    JUL 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +0.5	-2.1	-0.3</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
